  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>螢幕上的火焰效果降低！</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>適用於版本</strong> <strong>26.2</strong>&nbsp;<strong>至</strong></span> <span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>1.8</strong><strong>！</strong><strong><br></strong></span><span style=\"color:#f60\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\">（不需要 OptiFine！）</span><br><br></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:36px\"><strong>功能特色</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; 原版火焰&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; 低火焰效果 🔥</strong><strong><span style=\"color:#f60\"><br></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/433/29/half.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"633\"></span></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">✔️</span> </span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>當您處於燃燒狀態時，火焰不會覆蓋整個螢幕，僅顯示一小部分</strong></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;<br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/433/32/norm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"633\"></span></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">✔️ </span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>地面的火焰效果保持不變，與其他套件不同</strong></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/RRxvWKNC/images/8b3ce73ec529c01ee05c5f056a55db8a8095e6f2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"783\" height=\"407\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#000\">非常適合 PVP 或一般的 Minecraft 生存玩法<br>歡迎在您的 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\">CurseForge 整合包中使用此套件！</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">如果您有任何意見或建議，請在下方留言，我會盡力為您解決。</span></p>",
